On Tue, Dec 02, 2003 at 05:55:03PM +0800, Ow Mun Heng wrote:
> Hi All,
> 
> 	Simple question.. How do I find out what version of acpi is merged
> into the latest linux kernel (2.4.23)??

It tells you when it boots.. "ACPI CA 2003xxxx", or you could look at
the changelogs, or just grep for it ...

$ find include/acpi -type f |xargs grep 20031
include/acpi/acconfig.h:#define ACPI_CA_VERSION                 0x20031002

